>Here are some questions:  why can I sometimes not #offer at altars of my own
>alignment?  Often when I stand and #offer, I get the message "Nothing Happens."
>What am I doing wrong?

  If the corpse came from an undead monster (zombie, mummy, etc.), it
cannot be sacrificed.  Also, if the corpse is too old (more than 50 turns
since you killed it), it cannot be sacrificed.  Either of these things
will give you that message; so will sacrificing non-corpse-items, such
as food rations.

	-- Bill


